nkan Island."�They're stealing \C[5]Pinkan Berries\C[0], the fruits that turn the island's Pokémon pink. This is highly illegal, as Pinkan is a protected nature reserve."POur orders are to seize any stolen goods, and to shut down their operation."UEach of you will be assigned a partner Pokémon to help you traverse the island."{You have clearance to catch and fuse Pokémon on the island if necessary. This officer will supply you with gear as needed."~Stay sharp, Team Rocket is dangerous, as is the island. Use this if you need to call in backup to get you out of a tight spot."/Better not waste time. Let's bring 'em in!"DYou're \V[25], aren't you? We've had so many reports about you."#You're as strong as they said."|You're still young, kid. It's not too late to renounce your life of crime. You could have a bright future ahead of you."[It's too late. I tried to stop them, but another thief already picked this bush clean."qAre you proud of yourselves? Are you happy to be destroying this beautiful island for your own selfish gain?"0How did you find me all the way over here?!"&You crooks stole all my Pokémon!"GHahaha! This island is awesome! Why do you not want trainers here?"You're no fun!"HIt doesn't matter if you beat me, I'll go catch more pink Pokémon."DHalt! This is a protected area! I can't let you go any further!"&How could I lose to a mere grunt?"cYou hooligans have no respect for others, always barging in and causing chaos wherever you go!"�It's always the same song and dance with Team Rocket. Petty theft, intimidation, and ridiculous grand schemes we'll thwart again and again! Bahaha!",More Team Rocket! I'll defeat you both!"No, my sweet puppy!"mYou'll pay for this, just you wait. The rest of the force will have you in handcuffs before you know it!"EAre you the reinforcement I called for? Help me fight this thug!"You're doing good, rookie!"�Have you been catching Pokémon on the island? These Pokémon belong in the wild. Please give them to me so I can rele