ned out mansion anytime you want now that you are an honorary scientist!"Yes"No"Articuno"Zapdos"Moltres"Never mindIu;␀�[[%"]I found this very strange fossil in Mt. Moon! I think it's a rare, prehistoric Pokémon!"q\GIt has some strange powers. Your Pokémon might be able to learn them. I can teach it to them for $\V[15]."MTa-da! Come back if you want me to teach it to another of your Pokémon!"_That's too bad. Come back with $\V[15] if you want me to teach it to one of your Pokémon!"lYou don't have enough money. Come back with $\V[15] if you want me to teach it to one of your Pokémon!"#There's an e-mail message! ..."cThe 3 legendary bird POKEMON are ARTICUNO, ZAPDOS, and MOLTRES. Their whereabouts are unknown."5We plan to explore the cavern close to Cerulean." From: POKEMON RESEARCH TEAM"EHiya! I am important doctor! I study here rare Pokémon fossils!"{This fossil-reviving machine is the best of its kind. It can even revive Pokémon with their DNA extracted from amber!"+Let me know when you change your mind!"\Let me know if you ever find one and I'll revive it for you! Free of charge, of course!""Okay. I'll revive your \v[3]."=It worked perfectly. Here's your living fossil Pokémon!"?I'm looking for a Clefable! Wanna trade one for a Chansey?"AWhat? That's not Clefable! If you get one, trade it with me!"%Okay, connect the cable like so!"Thanks pal!"That's too bad."4How is my old Chansey? Clefable is doing great!"AHello there! Do you want to trade your Raichu for Electrode?";Hmmm? This isn't Raichu. Think of me when you get one."Hey thanks!""Well, if you don't want to..."HThe Raichu you traded to me went and evolved! How did this happen!?"6I'm looking for Ponyta! Wanna trade one for Seel?"=What? That's not Ponyta! If you get one, come back here!"Awww! Oh well..."Isn't my old Seel great?"Yes"No[%"a我在月见山\n发现了化石～！\1\n而且貌似还是\n罕见宝可梦的化石～！"�\G这块化石蕴藏着某种奇特的古代之力，\n你的宝可梦或许可以掌握！\1\n要花费\V[15]元来让你的宝可梦\n学习“原始之力”这个招式吗？"_好了！\n要是还想让其他宝可梦\n也学会这招的话，\n就再来找我吧！"Q这样啊……\n改主意了的话，\n就带着\V[15]元过来找我吧！"@你的钱不够呢。\n带够了\V[15]元再来找我吧。"(电脑里\n收到了一封邮件！"�火焰鸟、闪电鸟和急冻鸟\n是传说的鸟宝可梦。\1\n可是现在依然没有人知晓\n究竟能在哪里遇到它们。\1\n接下来我们将\n前去华蓝洞窟调查。\1\n总之先报告到这里。">我们计划前往华蓝市附近的洞窟进行调查。"#……宝可梦调查队敬上"�是啰～！\n我是熊厉害博士的啰！\1\n我致力于研究\n罕见的宝可梦的啰！\1\n你啰！\n有没有了不得的化石的啰？"�这台化石再生器是我研发的啰！\n它是同类型中最先进的啰！\1\n哪怕是从琥珀中提取的\n宝可梦DNA，它都能复活的啰！"你没有的啰……"N想复活化石记得来找我啰！\1\n再见啰！等你再来的啰！"�哇喔！\n那个是\v[3]！\1\n它是很久很久以前的宝可梦的化石啰！\1\n让我用我研发的化石再生器\n把它复活给你看的啰！"<成功了的啰！\1\n拿好你的化石宝可梦啰！"O我想要一只皮可西！\n拿我的吉利蛋和你交换，怎么样？"X什么啊？那不是皮可西！\n等你弄到了一只，再来找我交换吧！",好嘞，像这样把连接线接好！"谢啦，朋友！"啊～真是遗憾！"O我那只吉利蛋过得怎么样？\n皮可西在我这儿很幸福哦！"X你好呀，我想要一只雷丘！\n拿我的顽皮雷弹和你换，怎么样？"O嗯？这不是雷丘呀。\n等你有了一只雷丘，再来找我吧。"嘿嘿，多谢啦！"&好吧，不愿意就算啦……"W你换给我的那只雷丘\n居然进化了！\n这到底是怎么回事啊！？"R我想要一只小火马呢！\n拿我的小海狮跟你换，怎么样呀？"V什么嘛？这不是小火马哦！等你弄到了一只，再回来找我吧！"啊哦……好吧……"/我那只小海狮是不是超可爱的？"是"否;[%"]I found this very strange fossil in Mt. Moon! I think it's a rare, prehistoric Pokémon!"q\GIt has some strange powers. Your Pokémon might be able to learn them. I can teach it to them for $\V[15]."MTa-da! Come back if you want me to teach it to another of your Pokémon!"_That's too bad. Come back with $\V[15] if you want me to teach it to one of your Pokémon!"lYou don't have enough money. Come back with $\V[15] if you want me to teach it to one of your Pokémon!"#There's an e-mail message! ..."cThe 3 legendary bird POKEMON are ARTICUNO, ZAPDOS, and MOLTRES. Their whereabouts are unknown."5We plan to explore the cavern close to Cerulean." From: POKEMON RESEARCH TEAM"EHiya! I am important doctor! I study here rare Pokémon fossils!"{This fossil-reviving machine is the best of its kind. It can even revive Pokémon with their DNA extracted from amber!"+Let me know when you change your mind!"\Let me know if you ever find one and I'll revive it for you! Free of charge, of course!""Okay. I'll revive your \v[3]."=It worked perfectly. Here's your living fossil Pokémon!"?I'm looking for a Clefable! Wanna trade one for a Chansey?"AWhat? That's not Clefable! If you get one, trade it with me!"%Okay, connect the cable like so!"Thanks pal!