ent Charm"jTeam Rocket is preparing a heist on \C[5]Pinkan Island \C[0]. We must stop them before it's too late!"uI'm really sorry, but the previous Gym Leader has left unexpectedly to move to the Hoenn region with his family."OYou'll have to bear with us and wait until we find someone to replace him."It smells pretty gross."LI need to get a new bike, but the nearest shop is all the way in Kanto!"nThere's no way I'm getting a train ticket for this. Why can't they just open a shop in this city instead?"uKid, I get that you were trying to take down Team Rocket from within, but you can't wear their uniform for this!"uTeam Rocket is planning some kind of heist on an island called \C[5]Pinkan Island\C[0] and we need to stop them!"�We don't know exactly what they're after, but this island is a nature preserve that's full of rare Pokémon where no one is allowed to step foot."}There's also a rare kind of berry that grows on the island. It wouldn't surprise me if this was what Team Rocket was after..."�One last thing before we leave, \C[5]Pinkan Island\C[0] is a Pokémon sanctuary, so we cannot bring any Pokémon that aren't native to the island."LWe'll lend you a Pokémon to use once we're there. Are you ready to go?"a\C[2]You're about to begin a longer sidequest that might take up to a few hours to complete."�\C[2]If you leave before completing the event, your progress will <b>not</b> be saved and you will have to start over next time."-\C[2]Do you wish to start the sidequest?"hLet's not waste anymore time then! I'll take your bag and your Pokémon for safeskeeping. Let's go!"}Take the time you need to prepare! Once we're on the island, we won't be able to come back until this is all dealt with."VThe Radio Tower is old and creaky. They should replace it with a more modern one."cI like coming here at night. This city is just as vibrant as Saffron City, yet very different."gAnyway... How are you doing, \PN? You.. You'll become even stronger than you are now, I know it..."H.