o to worry for that old man in the Pokémon Tower, but he got what he deserved for standing in the way of Team Rocket."BYou see, Team Rocket captures Pokémon from around the world."GThey're important tools for keeping our criminal entreprise going."I am the leader, Giovanni!"7For your insolence, you will feel a world of pain!"WHAT! This cannot be!"$Triple Fusion experiment notes:"�Although the process still requires a tremendous amount of energy, the triple fusion machine prototype now appears to be fully operational."^Furthermore, the cause of the Mt. Moon experiment's failure has now also been identified."Read more?"�Unlike regular fusion, it appears that the Pokémon need to be of a similar strength and energy signature. Failing to do so results in a fusion that is too unstable to be viable."kIt is speculated that the energy requirement could be lessened by using it on Pokémon of great power."�The three legendary birds of Kanto seem like strong candidates for this experiment. However, these Pokémon are notoriously difficult to capture and living specimens have only been seen a few times in the recent years."9I see that you raise your Pokémon with utmost care."DA child like you would never understand what I hope to achieve.":I shall step aside this time! I hope we meet again..."#Whew! I'm lucky you were here!"@I never could've done it without your help. Thank you, \PN!"ZThis Silph Scope that Giovanni left behind... I think it helps to see Ghost-Pokémon."OWith this you'll be able to go save Mr. Fuji on top of the Pokémon Tower."1Okay then, I will be heading back to my gym."1You should come challenge me there sometime!"Yes"No[$"a《火箭队队员手册》\n详细记录了这个犯罪组织各项规章制度的指南。",里面记载了坂木的一些笔记。"……\V[1]"&开头部分似乎缺失了……"J对不起，\PN……\n我做不到……\1\n他实在是太强了！"F不得不承认，\n能来到这里，你们的确很不简单！"P你是靠这身制服\n骗过守卫进来的？\1\n罢了，无关紧要。"�你们为了营救富士老人\n而专程潜入我们的基地，\1\n勇气可嘉。\1\n但他挡了火箭队的路，\n落得任何下场都是咎由自取！"I你知道为什么火箭队\n要在世界各地捕捉宝可梦吗？"Y对火箭队来说，\1\n全世界的宝可梦都是\n用来谋取暴利的工具！"4而我坂木，\n就是这火箭队的老大！"F既然你要向我宣战，\n我就必须让你尝点苦头了！"=万万没有想到，\n我居然会输给一个孩子！" 三重融合实验记录："o虽然该实验仍需消耗大量能源，\n但三重融合机器的原型机\n目前似乎已可运作。"?此外，\n月见山实验的失败原因\n也已查明。"要继续阅读吗？"�与常规融合不同，\n三重融合要求宝可梦\n拥有相近的实力与能量特征。\1\n若不满足条件，\n融合体将极不稳定，无法正常存续。"c据推测，\n选用实力强大的宝可梦作为实验对象，\n或可降低能源消耗。"�关都地区三只传说的鸟宝可梦\n是本次实验的优质候选。\1\n然而，这些宝可梦极难捕捉，\n近年仅有寥寥数次活体目击记录。"@看来你也很认真地\n在培育你的宝可梦啊……"U可像你这样的孩子，大概是\n没办法理解我的远大理想吧……"m……！\n这次我就不陪你玩了！\1\n希望在其他地方\n还能再跟你一比高下……！"!呼！\1\n幸好有你在！"C没有你，我根本阻止不了坂木。\n谢谢你，\PN！"t坂木留下了这个西尔佛检视镜……\1\n戴上它应该就可以看见\n幽灵属性的宝可梦了。"I有了它，你应该能去宝可梦塔顶\n救出富士老人了！"/好了，那么我也该回道馆去了。":等事情都解决了，\n就来道馆挑战我吧！"是"否;[$"j"The Team Rocket Employee Handbook"\n It's a guide detailling the rules of the criminal organization."*It contains some of Giovanni's notes."...\V[1]".It looks like the beginning is missing..."D\PN! I'm sorry! I couldn't do anything. He was just too strong!"5So! I must say, I am impressed you got here too."FDid you get past my guards with this uniform? It does not matter."�It is noble of you two to worry for that old man in the Pokémon Tower, but he got what he deserved for standing in the way of Team Rocket."BYou see, Team Rocket captures Pokémon from around the world."GThey're important tools for keeping our criminal entreprise going."I am the leader, Giovanni!"7For your insolence, you will feel a world of pain!"WHAT! This cannot be!"$Triple Fusion experiment notes:"�Although the process still requires a tremendous amount of energy, the triple fusion machine prototype now appears to be fully operational."^Furthermore, the cause of the Mt. Moon experiment's failure has now also been identified."Read more?"�Unlike regular fusion, it appears that the Pokémon need to be of a similar strength and energy signature. Failing to do so results in a fusion that is too unstable to be viable."kIt is speculated that the energy requirement could be lessened by using it on Pokémon of great power."�The three legendary birds of Kanto seem like strong candidates for this experiment. However, these Pokémon are notoriously difficult to capture and living specimens have only 