e and its body's second type (if it's a dual type Pokémon)."�For example, a fusion of Butterfree (Bug-Flying) as the head with Tentacool (Water-Poison) as the body will be a Bug/Poison type Pokémon."XBut some Pokémon, such as evolved starter Pokémon always pass their primary type."HBoth halves of fused Pokémon evolve independantly from each other,"TEach half will evolve whenever the corresponding unfused Pokémon would evolve."BFused Pokémon naturally learn moves from both base Pokémon."hThe stats of fused Pokémon are determined by a weighed average of the stats of both base Pokémon."TThe Attack, Defense and Speed stats are closer to those of its body's Pokémon."eAnd the HP, Special Attack and Special Defense stats are closer to those of its head's Pokémon."sFused Pokémon get to choose between the body Pokémon's first ability and the head Pokémon's second ability."FThe one it gets can be chosen after fusing two Pokémon together."XIf you use DNA Splicers on an already fused Pokémon, the two Pokémon will unfuse."~Both of your Pokémon will revert to their original levels, but any experience they gained while they were fused is preserved."2Would you like to learn about something else?"6Do you want to know something cool about berries?"�When a Pokémon eats a berry it's holding, it will automatically hold another one after the battle if you have more in your bag."Try it out yourself!"$And wear this one on your head!"Pftt... Your loss!"mPokémon will automatically re-hold any consumable item after they're consumed if you have more of them!"Yes"No[."b黑板上贴着一张告示：\1\n\C[2]这个教室里的部分信息可能已经过时了。"?\C[2]最准确的信息请以\1\n无限融合Wiki为准！"h好大的地球仪啊。\1\n不过话说回来，地球仪的“仪”\n到底是什么意思啊？",你好！欢迎来到训练家学校！"5你想了解关于宝可梦融合的知识吗？"Q想成为出色的宝可梦训练家，\1\n知识可是非常重要的喔！"F这里有一张照片！\n是此前从未被发现的宝可梦！"#看起来实在太有型了！"W融合后的宝可梦能够学会\n两只宝可梦的招式。\n是不是很棒？"M嗯……\1\n原来皮皮是妖精属性的宝可梦啊。\n真有趣！"@这个游戏有Wiki百科哦。\1\n上网去查查看吧！"]勇基拉、豪力、鬼斯通和隆隆石\1\n通常是通过连接交换来进化的。"c不过，据说只要把它们培养到40级，\n就算不交换，它们也照样能进化！"[想做到那种程度的话，\n恐怕得是个相当了不起的训练家才行吧！"m要查看哪一个项目呢？\ch[81,9,融合,属性,进化,招式,种族值,特性,解除融合,取消]"M要让宝可梦融合，需要使用一种叫做基因之楔的道具。">你可以在任何一家友好商店花300元购买到。"�融合宝可梦时，选择的第一只宝可梦将决定融合后的身体，选择的第二只宝可梦则决定融合后的头部和配色。"J融合后宝可梦的等级，取两只宝可梦等级的平均值。"�一般来说，融合宝可梦的属性由头部的第一属性和身体的第二属性决定（如果该宝可梦是双属性的话）。"�比如说，用巴大蝶（虫+飞行）做头部，玛瑙水母（水+毒）做身体的话，融合出来的宝可梦就是虫+毒属性。"z不过，也有一些宝可梦是例外。比如进化后的初始宝可梦，就总是会遗传它的第一属性。";融合宝可梦的两个部分会各自独立进化。"A它们各自会在达成融合前的进化条件时进化。"A融合宝可梦可以学会两只基础宝可梦的招式。"t融合宝可梦的各项种族值，是由两只基础宝可梦的种族值通过加权平均计算得出的。"G攻击、防御和速度会更接近身体宝可梦的种族值。"J体力、特攻和特防则会更接近头部宝可梦的种族值。"h融合宝可梦可以选择身体宝可梦的第一特性，或是头部宝可梦的第二特性。"P两只宝可梦融合之后，就可以从这两个特性中选择一个。"e如果对已经融合的宝可梦再次使用基因之楔，两只宝可梦就会解除融合。"h两只宝可梦的等级都会恢复原状，但在融合期间获得的经验值会保存下来。"&你还有什么想了解的吗？"8想不想知道一些关于树果的有趣知识？"�当宝可梦吃掉持有的树果后，\1\n如果你的包包里\n还有更多同种类的树果，\n它会在战斗结束后再携带一个。"你自己试试看吧！" 把这个戴在头上吧！"&啧……不听是你的损失！"~宝可梦消耗掉持有物后，\1\n如果你还有更多同种类的道具，\n它就会在战斗结束后再携带一个！"是"否;[."nThere's a notice on the board: \C[2]Some of the information in this classroom might be slightly outdated."=\C[2]Check the Wiki for the most up-to-date information!"E\PN acquired some knowledge by looking intensively at the globe.")Hi! Welcome to the Pokémon Academy!"3Would you like to learn about Pokémon Fusion?"CKnowledge is very important to become a good Pokémon trainer!":It's a picture of a previously undiscovered Pokémon."-It looks cooler than any known Pokémon."HA fused Pokémon learns moves from both Pokémon. Isn't that great?"=Hmm.. So Clefairy is a Fairy type Pokémon. Interesting."5There's a Wiki for this game. Look it up online!"GKadabra, Machoke, Haunter and Graveler normally evolve by trading."iBut apparently, they'll also evolve without having to trade them if you can get them up to level 40!"HBut I bet you'd have to be an exceptional trainer to pull that off!"�What do you want to know about Pokémon Fusion? \ch[81,9,Fusing Pokémon,Typings,Evolution, Movesets,Stats,Abilities,Unfusing,Cancel]"CTo fuse Pokémon, you have to use an Item called DNA Splicers."7You can buy DNA Splicers at any PokéMart for $300"�When fusing Pokémon, whichever Pokémon is chosen first will give your fusion its body-shape. The other one will 