ycle. Never mind then."3Right, your reward! Of course I didn't forget!"oAs a reward for your racing prowesses, I'll upgrade your old Bicycle for a superior <b>Racing Bicycle</b>!"NYou'll be able to go much faster after I'm done with it. What do you say?" \PN handed out the Bicycle."7Here, all done! Enjoy your newly upgraded bicycle!"5Come see me whenever you're ready for our trade!"fHow are you enjoying your new Racing Bicycle? It's much faster than your previous bike, isn't it?"lYou can use the \C[1]Run Button\C[0] to match your old bicycle's speed if the speed is to much for you!"aA bunch of Grimers have started appearing on the Cycling Road. It's really quite unsanitary."FI would go get rid of them myself, but I don't know how to fight."ECould you help me get rid of all the Grimer on the cycling road?"TI really hope the Grimers will leave on their own then. Someone could get sick!"?The Grimer are dirtying up Route 17, aka the Cycling Road."RSomeone needs to step up and get rid of them quick or someone could get sick!"1You did it! You cleaned up the cycling road!"&Here's something for your effort!";Thanks to you the Cycling Road now smells much better!"%A voice echoed from somewhere...""\C[2]Find the next feather..."{Ouch! I was sitting by the water's edge in the Safari Zone, dipping my toes in the lake when something came and bit my toe!"cI couldn't see what it was, but it must've had some really sharp teeth for how much it hurt..."oI love hanging by the Safari Zone's lake, but now I don't dare to go back there unless I know what bit me!">Won't you try to find that sharp-toothed Pokémon for me?"Thanks, I owe you one!"MI don't dare to go back to the Safari Zone until I find out what bit me!"+Did you find the Pokémon that bit me?"sI may not have seen the Pokémon that bit me, but I'll recognize its teeth from the imprint it made on my toe!"JYes! This is the one! Its teeth are identical to the marks on my toe!"I guess I'll have to be more careful about where I dip my toes now that I know that there are Carvanha in the Safari Zone!"]I know! I'll put on some of these protective pads on my toes and I should be good to go!"/You can have some too, for helping me out!"nHm...? No, this Pokémon's teeth look different from the marks on my toe. That's not the one that bit me!"II found this poor Chansey over there all alone near the Safari Zone."JCould you help investigate and try to find the trainer it belongs to?"NOk, well just come back here if you ever hear anything about it, alright?"4I found this lost Chansey near the Safari Zone."+Please help me find who it belongs to!"CI cannot thank you enough for helping me find my Chansey back!"[Chansey is forever grateful too. She wanted to give you something as a thank you gift!"...See?"Seeeee! Seeeseesee!"=Chansey reached into its pouch and handed you something."It's noticeably empty."(<b>\C[6]NEW QUEST: Bicyle Race!</b>"^\C[1]Go meet the Cyclist at the bottom of Route 17 and beat her time up the Cycling Road!"[As a reward for your racing prowesses, I'll gift you a superior <b>Racing Bicycle</b>!">You'll be able to go much faster than with your old bike!"<I forgot to give you back your old bicycle. Here it is!"Yes"No[@"1你的宝可梦们\n变得精力充沛了！" 现在的时间是\V[74]。"z我们是不惧黑夜的赛车手～\n雷速登上不尽的征途！\1\n啊，你也觉得自己是赛车高手吗？"]要是你能在自行车道上\n打破我的最佳纪录，\n我就给你一份奖励。"怎么样？"1这么着急想赛一场吗！\n真不错！"7那好！\n到自行车道的底部来找我吧！"7哈！\n没想到你还真敢接受竞速挑战！":呃，你连自行车都没有。\n那就算了吧。"F对哦，你的奖励！\n我怎么可能忘呢，哈哈哈哈！"�为了奖励你\n在下坡竞速赛中展现的非凡车技，\n我会把你的自行车升级为\n性能更强的<b>音速自行车</b>！"7改装之后，车速会快很多。\n怎么样？".\PN把自行车\n交给了自行车手。"O好了，大功告成！\n好好享受全新升级的音速自行车吧！"2想要升级自行车，就再来找我吧！"R升级后的自行车骑起来感觉如何？\n比以前那辆快多了吧？"e要是觉得速度太快，\n按下\C[1]跑步键\C[0]就能切换回普通自行车的速度！"L最近自行车道上冒出了好多臭泥，\n实在太不卫生了。"C我倒是想去赶走它们，\n可我根本不会对战……"@你能帮我把自行车道上那些臭泥\n都赶走吗？"R真希望这些臭泥能自己离开，\n再这样下去有人会生病的！"D17号道路\n也就是自行车道上，\n到处都是臭泥。"a必须有人挺身而出，把它们尽快赶走。\n不然早晚会有人因此生病的！"7太好了！\n你把自行车道清理干净了！".辛苦你了！\n这是给你的谢礼！";多亏有你，现在自行车道的气味好多了！"C不知从何处传来的声音，\n在你的耳边回荡……"P\C[2]为吾……寻得四羽……\1\n于关都之北，环水之宅……"�哎哟！疼、疼、疼死我了！\n我本来坐在狩猎地带的湖边泡脚，\n结果有什么东西游过来咬了我一口！"U我没看清是什么，但咬得那么疼，\n它的牙齿肯定很锋利……"u我很喜欢去狩猎地带的湖边待着，\n可现在搞不清咬我的是什么，\n我都不敢回去了！"F你能帮我去找找那只\n长着锋利牙齿的宝可梦吗？")谢啦，算我欠你一个人情！"U弄清楚是什么咬了我之前，\n我可不敢再踏进狩猎地带半步！"/你找到咬我的那只宝可梦了吗？"�虽然我没看清咬我的是什么，\n但它留在我脚趾上的牙印\n可是清清楚楚！\n只要比对一下，我就能认出来！"I没错！就是它！\n它的牙齿和我脚趾牙印完全吻合！"[原来狩猎地带里有利牙鱼啊，\n看来以后泡脚的时候得小心点了！"@有了！\n我给脚趾装上护具不就没问题了吗！"7你帮了我这么大忙，\n也分你一些吧！"s嗯……？\1\n不对，这只宝可梦的牙齿\n和我脚趾上的牙印对不上。\n咬我的不是它！"p我在狩猎地带附近发现了这只吉利蛋，\n它孤零零地待在那里，看起来怪可怜的。"L你能帮忙调查一下，\n看看能不能找到它的训练家吗？"[好，要是你找到什么相关消息的话，\n就回来告诉我一声，好吗？"F我是在狩猎地带附近发现的\n这只走失的吉利蛋。"/麻烦你帮我找到它的训练家吧！"/感谢你帮我找回了我的吉利蛋！"R吉利蛋也也特别感激你。\n它想送你一份礼物来表达谢意！"……吉利？"吉～利！吉吉吉！"L吉利蛋把手伸进育儿袋，\n掏出了一样东西递给了你。" 垃圾箱内空空如也！"/<b>\C[6]新任务：下坡竞速赛！</b>"s\C[1]前往17号道路底部\n与那位自行车手会合。\n参加下坡竞速赛，并打破她的纪录！"}为了奖励你\n在下坡竞速赛中展现的非凡车技，\n我会送给你一辆性能更强的<b>音速自行车</b>！"5它的速度可比你的旧自行车快多了！":我忘了把你的旧自行车还给你了。\n给！"是"否;[@"&Your Pokémon are full of energy!" The current time is \V[74]."Think you're a fast racer?"NI'll give you something if you can beat my best time up the Cycling Road."What do you say?"#So eager to race! I like that!"?Okay then! Come meet me at the bottom of the cycling road!"7Hah! I didn't think you'd be up for the challenge!"7Oh, you don't even own a bicycle. Never mind then."3Right, your reward! Of course I didn't forget!"oAs a reward for your racing prowesses, I'll upgrade your old Bicycle for a superior <b>Racing Bicycle</b>!"NYou'll be able to go much faster after I'm done with it. What do you say?" \PN handed out the Bicycle."7Here, all done! Enjoy your newly upgraded bicycle!"5Come see me whenever you're ready for our trade!"fHow are you enjoying your new Racing Bicycle? It's much faster than your previous bike, isn't it?"lYou can use the \C[1]Run Button\C[0] to match your old bicycle's speed if the speed is to much for you!"aA bunch of Grimers have started appearing on the Cycling Road. It's really quite unsanitary."FI would go get rid of them myself, but I don't know how to fight."ECould you help me get rid of all the Grimer on the cycling road?"TI really hope the Grimers will leave on their own then. Someone could get sick!"?The Grimer are dirtying up Route 17, aka the Cycling Road."RSomeone needs to step up and get rid of them quick or someone could get sick!"1You did it! You cleaned up the cycling road!"&Here's something for your effort!";Thanks to you the Cycling Road now smells much better!"%A voice echoed from somewhere...""\C[2]Find the next feather..."{Ouch! I was sitting by the water's edge in the Safari Zone, dipping my toes in the lake when something came and bit my toe!"cI couldn't see what it was, but it must've had some really sharp teeth for how much it hurt..."oI love hanging by the Safari Zone's lake, but now I don't dare to go back there unless I know what bit me!">Won't you try to find that sharp-toothed Pokémon for me?"Thanks, I owe you one!"MI don't dare to go back to the Safari Zone until I find out what bit me!"+Did you find the Pokémon that bit me?"sI may not have seen the Pokémon that bit me, but I'll recognize its teeth from the imprint it made on my toe!"JYes! This is the one! Its teeth are identical to the marks on my toe!"I guess I'll have to be more careful about where I dip my toes now that I know that there are Carvanha in the Safari Zone!"]I know! I'll put on some of these protective pads on my toes and I should be good to go!"/You can have some too, for helping me out!"nHm...? No, this Pokémon's teeth look different from the marks on my toe. That's not the one that bit me!"II found this poor Chansey over there all alone near the Safari Zone."JCould you help investigate and try to find the trainer it belongs to?"NOk, well just come back here if you ever hear anything about it, alright?"4I found this lost Chansey near the Safari Zone."+Please help me find who it belongs to!"CI cannot thank you enough for helping me find my Chansey back!"[Chansey is forever grateful too. She wanted to give you something as a thank you gift!"...See?"Seeeee! Seeeseesee!"=Chansey reached into its pouch and handed you something."It's noticeably empty."(<b>\C[6]NEW Q