ou have no room in your party to store the egg."Too bad..."_Not many people live in the Sevii Islands, but we get tourists from all around the region!"mHeart Scales are often used as a currency here in the Sevii Islands. So you better start saving them up!"<Thank you for using the \C[1]Trainer Card Printer\C[0]."r\GWould you like to purchase a new background for your Trainer Card? The current price is \C[5]$\V[329]\C[0]."H\HSHey, I'll trade you a Nugget for a Heart Scale. What do you say?"&\HS\PN handed over a Heart Scale."BOh... You don't have enough Heart Scales. That's unfortunate."No worries!"1Heart Scales are worth more than gold to me!"JA stranger from Unova sold me this egg, but I can't seem to hatch it."BOh, you're a Trainer! That means you're using Pokémon Boxes!"gMy name's Bebe! You know the PC Pokémon Boxes? I'm the system administrator in the Sinnoh region!"OI'm helping Celio install a new connection to Sinnoh's PC Storage network."OWe're almost done setting it up, but we're missing an important component."`Celio says he might've dropped it on Treasure Beach when he got spooked by a wild Oricorio.""Argh, this is so frustrating!"4Oh.. Could this be the missing network adapter?"It is! You're a lifesaver!"/Here, let me just install this real quick."1Ok, now I just need to sync it with your PC."It worked perfectly!"8Finally, the \C[1]Box Link\C[0] is now operational!"NThis is a portable device that allows you to access the PC from anywhere!"lWell now if you excuse me, I have to go set up the PCs on the other islands, so I'll have to get going."Bye Celio! See ya, \PN!"zWhat a disaster! I was attacked by a pack of bird Pokémon on my way from Treasure Beach and I lost the Network Chip!"dIt's an essential component to the new communication system we're installing. This is terrible!"{What a disaster! I was attacked by a pack of bird Pokémon on my way from Treasure Island and I lost the Network Chip!"2Thank you for finding this Network Chip, \PN!"bThis machin