it. It's designed to finish up the opponent in a set amount of time."\C[7]...BZZZT..."%\C[7]ACQUIRE TARGET.... BZZZT..."2Huh? you're that kid from Goldenrod Tunnel..."FListen, a trade's a trade. I ain't giving you back your Pokémon."Humph... I'm out of here!"ZHumph... Alright then, here's your Pokemon back... It wasn't even that strong anyway."UThis is the Y.E.L.L.O.W. unit. It's designed to deal as much damage as possible."%SEGMENTATION FAULT (CORE DUMPED)"FHmm... It seems like the robot wasn't quite calibrated correctly."RI'm impressed, but I will work hard to make the final version more versatile."[This is the B.L.U.E unit. It's designed to defeat any opponent as quickly as possible." ERROR DETECTED... REBOOTING"What a turn of events!"IIt looks like the prototype isn't quite working perfectly after all." The Robot isn't responding."KThis is the C.Y.A.N. unit. It's designed to defeat enemies in one hit."EWe've been working on this robot. Uh? It looks a bit like you..."JWe've been working on this robot. It's very technologically advanced."[This is a R.E.D. unit. It's controlled by a top-edge Trainer AI. It's 100% unbeatable!"Don't believe us?"LHow about this, I'll give you something really good if you can beat it!"$This is the wise choice indeed."BZZZ... MALFUNCTION!"IThere's no shame in losing. This machine was built to be unbeatable!"No"Yes00Iu;␀t[["Linooo!"'Necrozma vanished into thin air...["奈克洛！"/奈克洛兹玛消失得无影无踪……;["Linooo!"'Necrozma vanished into thin air...Iu;␀C[[ "HSo the cause of this sudden darkness might be a psychic Pokémon..."BYes, this makes a lot of sense. But where could it be hiding?"\Greetings, young one. Have you met my grand-daughter, Sabrina in the gym next door yet?"�Sabrina's mother and I, we used to watch her grow amidst the peaceful aura of this place. The bond she shares with the spirits, it's a gift and a responsibility."qAh, welcome, dear traveler. I see you're one of the brave souls seeking answers to the encroaching darkness."�Sabrina's told you about our connection to the hidden dimension, hasn't she? I can share a bit more with you, if you're willing to listen."gYou see, there's a realm unseen, a dimension where thoughts, dreams, and consciousness intertwine."�Every living being, humans and Pokémon alike, sends and receives messages through this ethereal channel. Yet, these messages seldom reach our conscious minds; they're felt as intuition or inspiration."LThis dimension is a thread that binds all alternate universes together."�Now, Psychic Pokémon possess a rare gift-they can consciously interact with this dimension. This is what allows them to control minds and send telepathic messages."eMy family, including my granddaughter Sabrina, is among those born with this remarkable ability."�Sabrina and I share this connection across time and space. We've used it to communicate, even to speak with another gifted individual from another world."�That someone lived in a place called \C[1]Ultra Megalopolis\C[0]. Much like Sabrina, they possessed the power to emit messages through our shared dimension."LBut it has been a long time since they last attempted to communicate..."gThey spoke of a calamity that befell their world-a malevolent presence called \C[1]Necrozma \C[0]."�This sinister being arrived, swallowing light and plunging their world into an endless night. The very essence of their existence was drained, leaving naught but darkness behind."�I fear, dear traveler, that the same dark fate threatens our Kanto. \C[1]Necrozma\C[0]'s reach knows no bounds, spanning across universes to cast its shadow."�Please, for the sake of our worlds and all that inhabit them, put an end to this menace. Our hopes, our minds, and our strength are with you on this perilous journey."Very well then."tI fear that the light may never return to our region. Just like what happened that city from the other world..."�Truly, your courage has pierced the darkness that sought to envelop our world. Light and hope have returned, and Saffron City once again pulses with vibrant energy."xYour actions have bridged the gap between realms, showing us the strength of bonds forged in the face of adversity."The echoes of gratitude reverberate through this city, and I offer my heartfelt thanks for your role in this momentous triumph."Yes"No"
Go on"That's enough[ "j这么说来，这片突如其来的黑暗，\n源头可能是一只超能力属性的宝可梦……"I嗯，逻辑上完全说得通。\n可它究竟会藏在哪里呢？"`你好啊，年轻人。\n你见过我孙女娜姿了吗？\n就是金黄道馆的馆主。"�我和娜姿的母亲\n看着她在这片祥和的灵气中长大。\n她与灵体之间的联结，\n既是天赋，也是责任。"P啊，欢迎你，年轻人。你是来追寻这片黑暗的真相的吧？"|娜姿应该告诉过你，\n我们一族与异空间的联系吧？\n如果你愿意听，我可以再和你多讲一些。"{世间存在着一个\n常人无法窥见的空间，\n在那个空间度里，思想、梦境与意识彼此交织。"�所有生灵，无论人类还是宝可梦，\n都通过这条灵界通道传递、接收讯息。\n只是这些讯息\n极少能抵达我们的显意识，\n大多只化作“直觉”或“灵感”\n而被我们所感知。"@这个空间，是串联起\n所有平行宇宙的纽带。"�而超能力宝可梦\n拥有一项稀有的天赋\n——它们能够主动\n与这个空间产生交互。\n也正因如此，它们才能\n操控心智、传递心电感应。"X我们一族，包括我的孙女娜姿，\n生来便拥有这份非凡的能力。"{我和娜姿凭借这份联结\n可以跨越时空交流，\n甚至还曾与另一个世界的\n一位超能力者对话。"�那个超能力者住在一个叫做\n\C[1]究极大都会\C[0]的地方。\n和娜姿一样，他也拥有\n通过维度空间传递讯息的力量。"U只不过……距离上一次联络至今，\n已经过去很久很久了……"w他说起过降临在他们世界的一场浩劫。\n那是一个名为\C[1]奈克洛兹玛\C[0]的邪恶存在。"�那个邪恶之物降临之后，\n吞噬了所有光芒……\n让他们的世界陷入了漫漫长夜。\n万物的生命本源都被抽干，\n只余下一片死寂的黑暗。"�年轻人啊，同样的黑暗命运，\n或许正降临在我们关都地区。\n\C[1]奈克洛兹玛\C[0]的影响力没有边界，\n它能跨越宇宙，投射无尽的阴影。"�拜托你！\n为了我们的世界，\n为了世间所有生灵，\n阻止这场浩劫！\n我们的祈愿、心念与力量，都与你同在！"那好吧……"p我怕这片地区的光，再也回不来了……\n就像那座异世界城市曾经经历过的一样。"�你的勇气刺穿了\n妄图吞噬我们世界的黑暗。\n光明与希望重归大地，\n金黄市也将再次焕发出蓬勃的生机。"�你的行动，架起了\n连接不同世界的桥梁，\n也让我们见证了\n逆境中缔结的牵绊，拥有何等的力量。"~整座城市都回荡着感激之声，\n我也为你在这次伟大胜利中\n所做的一切，致以衷心的感谢！"是"否"请您继续"我还有事;[ "HSo the cause of this sudden darkness might be a psychic Pokémon..."BYes, this makes a lot of sense. But where could it be hiding?"\Greetings, young one. Have you met my grand-daughter, Sabrina in the gym next door yet?"�Sabrina's mother and I, we used to watch her grow amidst the peaceful aura of this place. The bond she shares with the spirits, it's a gift and a responsibility."qAh, welcome, dear traveler. I see you're one of the brave souls seeking answers to the encroaching darkness."�Sabrina's told you about our connection to the hidden dimension, hasn't she? I can share a bit more with you, if you're willing to listen."gYou see, there's a realm unseen, a dimension where thoughts, dreams, and consciousness intertwine."�Every living being, humans and Pokémon alike, sends and receives messages through this ethereal channel. Yet, these messages seldom reach our conscious minds