t you dare condescend me! This was not part of the deal that we've discussed."sDo I need to remind you of what Team Rocket does to those who are not able to uphold their end of the bargain?"JPlease no... You... you just have to give it more time, that's all..."Very well. But know that the consequences will be worse than you can imagine if somehow, Silph is not able to meet our demands."6Uh.. Boss? These kids that just walked in here..."Ah \PN! So we meet again!"EThe president and I are discussing a vital business proposition."NKeep your nose out of grown-up matters... Or, experience a world of pain!"Arrgh!! I lost again!?"2Blast it all! You ruined our plans for Silph!"&But, Team Rocket will never fall!"wIt seems like this machine has already ran its course anyway... Despite what this liar of a chairman keeps saying."{It's less than ideal, but these three Master Balls that it's already produced will be enough to achieve our ambitions."^\PN! Never forget that all Pokémon exist for Team Rocket! I must go, but I shall return!"+Well, \PN! I'm moving on up and ahead!"TBy checking my Pokédex, I'm starting to see what's strong and how they evolve!"pI'm going to the Pokémon League to boot out the Elite Four! I'll become the world's most powerful trainer!";You should probably go check out this city's gym next."_Once you've beaten Sabrina, you'll be able surf around the region to find better Pokémon!"GAnyway that's what I'd do if I were you! Don't sweat it! Smell ya![!",坚守正义，便是与邪恶为敌！"-西尔佛公司总部\n11楼：董事会"喂！你走错路啦！"2我在这儿能听到坂木老大的声音！"v你以为到了11楼\n就能见到坂木老大？\n想得美！\n社长室只能通过传送装置才能到达。"�我的人刚刚告诉我，\n贵公司慷慨提供的那台机器\n在只生产了三个大师球之后\n就彻底罢工了……"�如果我没记错的话，\n您当初承诺的产量\n可远不止这些。\n您该不会是在机器的性能上\n骗了我吧？"�这……这机器本来就不是为了\n制造这么精密的精灵球而设计的。\n我也不知道该怎么跟你解释……\n如果我们有更多时间准备……"c这和我们之前说好的可不一样。\n你这是在敷衍我吗！\n谁给你的胆子！"I需要我提醒你，欺骗火箭队的人\n会是什么下场吗？"p求求你不要……\n你……\n您……\n您再给我们一点时间就好……\n就一点时间……"�很好，那我就再给你一次机会。\n但记住，如果再让我失望……\n你和西尔佛的下场，\n就不止绝望这么简单了。"C呃……老大？\n是那两个在公司捣乱的小鬼……".呵，是\PN吗？\n我们又见面了！"C我正在和西尔佛的社长\n讨论重要的商业计划。"�像你这样的小孩子，\n就别在大人的世界里瞎掺和了！\1\n如果你无论如何都想插手，\n那我也只能让你吃些苦头了！""呜啊！\n我竟然输了！"C可恶……没办法！\n我只能暂时放弃西尔佛了！"4不过，\n我们火箭队是不会倒下的！"u看样子，那台机器也榨不出什么了……\n这位谎话连篇的社长辩解再多\n也无济于事。"u虽然不算理想，\n但凭借这三颗已经造好的大师球，\n也刚好足够实现我们的野望了。"�\PN，你听好了！\n这世上所有的宝可梦\n都是为火箭队而存在的！\1\n你最好给我记住！\1\n那么……！\n我就先告辞了！\1\n不过，我一定会卷土重来的！"/好了，\PN！我也该继续前进了！"h多亏了宝可梦图鉴，该如何培育、进化强大的宝可梦，我已经心里有数了！"o四天王算什么？\n我这就去把他们收拾掉！\n世界最强训练家的宝座，非我莫属！"I倒是你，接下来你应该去挑战\n这座城市的道馆吧？"l等你战胜了娜姿，\n就能用冲浪在整个地区到处探索，\n捕捉更强的宝可梦了！"`总之随你啦，是我的话肯定会这么做！\n道馆而已，别紧张！\n回见！;[!"/If you stand for justice, you betray evil!"0Silph Co. Head Office\n11F: Executive Board"%Hey! You're going the wrong way!"#I can hear Giovanni from here!"KNice try, but the boardroom is only accessible from the teleport pads."�My employees were just telling me that the machine that you've kindly provided to us seems to have stopped working entirely after producing only three Master Balls..."vAs I recall, the numbers you promised were much higher. Have you perhaps been lying to me about its capabilities?"�It's... it was never designed to print such a sophisticated ball. I don't know what to tell you, Giovanni. It simply needs more time."VDon't you dare condescend me! This was not part of the deal that we've discussed."sDo I need to remind you of what Team Rocket does to those who are not able to uphold their end of the bargain?"JPlease no... You... you just have to give it more time, that's all..."Very well. But know that the consequences will be worse than you can imagine if somehow, Silph is not able to meet our demands."6Uh.. Boss? These kids that just walked in here..."Ah \PN! So we meet again!"EThe president and I are discussing a vital business proposition."NKeep your nose out of grown-up matters... Or, experience a world of pain!"Arrgh!! I lost again!?"2Blast it all! You ruined our plans for Silph!"&But, Team Rocket will never fall!"wIt seems like this machine has already ran its course anyway... Despite what this liar of a chairman keeps saying."{It's less than ideal, but these three Master Ball