Down!"!Listen up and remember this!"-Get ready... Press the buttons!\wtnp[20]"Correct!\wtnp[40]"Incorrect!\wtnp[40]"EWhat do you think? Do you think any of these have any potential?"Not really..."{1} is pretty cool!"I like {1}!"5It's a vending machine. What do you want to buy?"Purchase anything else?"�Sootopolis Void attacked the city and tried to steal a precious package from the Rangers headquarters. Littleroot Crimson was able to stop him, but now he's coming back with a vengeance..."zThere was a part where Littleroot Crimson had a rematch with Fallarbor Bordeaux and he finally evolved his Combusken."�There was an entire subplot about Rustboro Ivory entering a berry-growing contest that she ended up winning with a super-mutant berry."There was a part where Lilicove Viridian waited until the wind picked up to catch a Pidgeot that had been terrorizing the town."jAt one point, Mauville Yellow met a scientist in the woods and helped him collect highly toxic spore."kLittleroot Crimson seeked out the help of the grandmaster that was hiding at the end of the dark cave."IRustboro Ivory befriended that lonely Oricorio in the flowers field."'The Oricorio kept switching forms!"�Mauville Yellow fused a Pellipper with Exploud to create a sonic weapon. And then it ended up being much too loud, it was so funny!"IPacifidlog Cobalt found that shiny Azumarill. I never saw it coming!"{At least, Littleroot Crimson finally delivered that precious package. I can't wait to see what happens next with that."UHey, that part where Fallarbor Bordeaux fished up that Dragalge was pretty neat."bThat whole subplot about Pacifidlog Cobalt trying to get a tan definitely dragged on a bit..."nAlthough that scene with Lilicove Viridian beating up all the bad guys in the beach house was really fun!"sThe chase sequence with the Kingler when Mauville Yellow was carrying that beach ball was really funny though!"UI never expected Littleroot Crimson to infiltrate the villains's lair like that!"