ful, charming appearance."Short Spikes"AA short, spiky hairstyle popular with the alternative crowd."Single Back Braid",A simplistic long braid along the back."Slick Mullet"|A slicked-back mullet. It was popular when your parents were young, but it has since started to come back into fashion."High Side Pony"`An elegant ponytail worn to the side that was popularized by a Galarian research assistant."Eon Bob"SA layered bob with long, outward curls, exuding a gentle and mysterious charm."Surge Spikes"EA spiky haircut often worn by members of the Kantonian military."Tied-back Wicks"YFour very thick, chunky, cylindrical locs tied back behind the head in a cool style."Tied-back Dreads"iSome dreads that are half-up, half-down. It keeps them out of your face while still looking stylish."Torchic Tuft"OA topknot-style ponytail inspired by the little tufts on a torchic's head."Tyranaspikes"9Sharp spikes that look like the hide of a Tyranitar."Flyaway Short Cut"_A messy, wind-swept crop with long, asymmetrical bangs that's popular in the Kalos region."Veteran Bob"`Short, practical hair styled into a neat bob with subtle layers, giving a no-nonsense look."Spiky Sideburns"lA spiky hairstyle with long sideburns. This style was popularized by Volkner, a Gym Leader from Sinnoh."Electrified Elder Hair"KThick beard and hair combo that sticks up in a single, prominent tuft."Wavy Hair"?A cute, short, wavy bob. It flows beautifully in the wind."Wavy Ponytail"5A simple and cute ponytail made up of wavy hair."Messy Spikes"[A short, spiky hairdo. It's been messed up from riding around on a motorcycle all day."Spiky Low Pigtails"kLow pigtails that give a youthful look to the wearer. The style was popularized by Gym Leader Whitney."Magician's Bob"XA short hairstyle with mysterious, side-parted bangs like Will of the Elite Four's."Absol Cap"ZA hat that resembles the visage of Absol. Hopefully, wearing this won't be an omen..."Aerodactyl Skull">An Aerodactyl skull that perfectly fits over a trainer's."Aqua Clip"OA hair clip in the shape of a tear drop, popular with water-type trainers."Aqua Bandana"9A dark bandana that's part of the Team Aqua uniform!"Worn Aqua Bandana"fA tight bandana that was part of the Team Aqua uniform a long time ago. It feels a bit nostalgic."Aron Mask"9A heavy, steel mask shaped like the head of an Aron."Partner Cap"]An iconic cap with a stylized green "L" on it. It feels a bit nostalgic for some reason."Baneful Fox Mask"TAn eerie fox mask that ressembles how Zoroarks were depicted in ancient fables."
