 to cold weathers."Electric Outfit"5A casual outfit themed around the Electric type."Emerald Gear">A floaty jacket inspired by the color scheme of Spinarak."Caph Squad Captain"aA fierce-looking outfit worn by the captain of the Caph Squad, otherwise known as Team Star."Traveller Outfit"<The outfit of a traveler who came from a far-away land."Faux Wrap Dress"bAn elegant, lightweight dress perfect for a day on the beach or a walk through flower fields."Fighting Outfit"zA sportsy outfit that is liked by those who practice martial arts. It captures the essence of Fighting-type Pokémon."Fire Outfit"IA fire-proof outfit that captures the essence of fire-type Pokémon."Fisherman's Vest"mTypically seen on fishermen, this outfit sports a vest and cargo pants made to hold all sorts of tackle."Floral Dress">A sleeveless dress adorned with a vibrant floral pattern."Flower Jumper"3A jumper suit with a beautiful floral pattern."Flying Outfit"hAn aerodynamic outfit for gliding through the air. It captures the essence of Flying-type Pokémon."Fossil Seeker's Garb"@An old-timey dress worn by paleontologists and fossil fans."Frosted ski outfit"QA comfortable and well insulated ski outfit reminiscent of an ice type moth."Fusion Outfit";A cool, scientific outfit inspired by Pokémon fusion."Ghost Outfit"UA tattered, disheveled ensemble. It captures the essence of Ghost-type Pokémon."Bad Egg Outfit"You shouldn't have this."Sporty Red Outfit"UA comfy red jacket and white shorts. It's worn by fledgling trainers from Johto."Goth Hoodie"oA dark, oversized hoodie with a skull emblem, paired with ripped leggings for expressing your inner rebel."Grass Outfit"}A charming outfit that resembles a beautiful flower found deep in the forest. It captures the essence of Grass-Type Pokémon."Ground Outfit"[A rugged cowboy outfit with earthy tones that captures the essence of the Ground type."Gymwear"OForm fitting gym clothes that accentuate a trainer's rippling musculature."Happiny 