piring maid."Marshweater"=A comfortable sweater designed to look like a Marshtomp."Sapphire Strider"WA sporty, travel-ready outfit that evokes the spirit of a fledgling Hoenn trainer."Fairy Outfit (F)"UA whimsical pastel sweater and skirt that capture the essence of the Fairy type."Fairy Outfit (M)"ZA light pastel sweater and tailored pants that capture the essence of the Fairy type."Mod Dress"�A retro dress from several decades ago. Its square design and go-go boots made it popular with young trainers looking to match their Pokemon."Naranja Academy Outfit"VThe summer uniform worn by students of the prestigious Naranja Academy in Paldea."Normal Outfit"MA brown jacket with a scarf that capture the essence of the Normal-type."Harmonious Outfit"eThe outfit of a Pokémon whisperer. Wearing it makes you feel like you understand your Pokémon."Nurse Uniform")Pink nurse scrubs worn by Nurse Joy."Office Worker (F)"HA classy, professional-looking pink business suit and pencil skirt."Office Worker (M)"[A sharp white button-up shirt with a tie that offers a polished and professional look."Bulbasaur Overalls"SA set of overalls themed after a familiar green starter from the Kanto region."Charmander Overalls"TA set of overalls themed after a familiar orange starter from the Kanto region."Squirtle Overalls"RA set of overalls themed after a familiar blue starter from the Kanto region."Pink Pyjamas"<Comfy pink pyjamas with a Poké Ball logo on the shirt."Royale Outfit Z"gA comfortable outfit from Kalos. It has a vibrant logo on the back associated with the Z-A Royale."Pikachu Pyjamas"-Comfy blue pyjamas with a Pikachu print."Pikachu Onesie"1A cozy onesie designed to look like Pikachu."Breeder Outfit"=A comfortable outfit commonly worn by Pokémon Breeders."Venomous Vest (M)"oA striking, brightly colored outfit that is designed to warn those with weak hearts to stay away from you."WA comfortable outfit with bright, striking colors inspired by poison-type Pokemon."Venomous Vest (F)"Police Uniform"HThe official uniform worn by the Kanto and Johto Police Department."Psychic outfit (M)"Ta traditional outfit of shamans it captures the essence of Psychic-type pokemon"Psychic outfit (F)"Ta traditional outfit of healers it captures the essence of Psychic-type pokemon"Gardener Outfit"cAn outfit worn by gardeners. It was popularized by a certain Gym Leader from the Kalos region."Ranger Uniform"MThe uniform worn by those who dedicate their lives to protecting nature."Red jacket and Jeans"LYour favourite red jacket and jeans that you always wear on adventures!"Luxury Suit (Light)"bA sharp, white suit that screams luxury and confidence for trainers who like to win in style."Luxury Suit (Dark)"aA sharp, dark suit that screams luxury and confidence for trainers who like to win in style."Team Rocket Uniform (F)"GThe feminine version of the Team Rocket uniform every Grunt wears."White Rocket Uniform (M)"QA white variant of the Team Rocket uniform that every Grunt wears. Right...?"White Rocket Uniform (F)"Team Rocket Uniform (M)"HThe masculine version of the Team Rocket uniform every Grunt wears."Roserade Suit (F)"1A feminine green suit resembling a Roserade."Roserade Suit (M)"2A masculine green suit resembling a Roserade."Primitive Clothes (F)"�An outfit inspired by styles that were popular thousands of years ago. Just wearing it makes you feel like you've gone back to the prehistoric age."Primitive Clothes (M)"Sandshrew Outfit"�A pants and cape set designed with a texture mimicking Sandshrew's hide that allows you to easily blend in with desert environments."Black and Red Jacket"VThis dark ensemble will intimidate your rivals as you take on the Pokemon League."Slow Suit"SThe ultimate chill costume, complete with a giant shell chomping on your tail."Sludge Drip"EA sporty outfit inspired by the colors of Alolan Muk and Grimer."Blue Snow Coat (F)"OA warm blue coat, red skirt, leggings and boots, perfect for cold weather."