 t-shirt with a stripe across the middle. It's paired with shorts that are comfy and easy to wear."Printed Tee and Shorts"fA yellow t-shirt with a design on front. It's paired with shorts that are comfy and easy to wear."Yellow Tee and Shorts"OA baggy yellow t-shirt paired with shorts that are comfy and easy to wear."Zigzagoon Sweater"WA warm, fuzzy sweater sporting a striped pattern that resembles a Zigzagoon's fur."Short Cut with Antenna"wA simple short hairstyle with an antenna that sticks up like a Heracross's, like Aaron of the Sinnoh Elite Four's."Balanced Bun"UA practical bun worn by ace trainers. It kind of looks like a Medicham's helmet."Slick Spikes"^Short spikes slick with gel, so your hair doesn't fall down in your face while you train."	Afro"dA full, fluffy afro that's big, bold, and impossible to ignore, perfect for making a statement!"Baby Hair"PA single curled strand of hair that makes you look like you were just born."	Bald"OA completely bald look - no hair, no fuss, just pure, unadulterated scalp!"Messy Afro"fA flattened afro with an unkempt, rounded shape, offering a low-maintenance yet distinctive look."Bob Cut"ZA sleek bob cut with chin-length hair that frames the face with a sharp, modern edge."Bowl Cut"fA classic bowl cut with evenly trimmed hair all around, offering a neat and straightforward look."Box Braided Buns"VA half-up, half-down hairstyle featuring cute, poofy buns and elegant box braids."Box Braids"6A cascade of long, elegant, intricate box braids."Braided Buns"YThis space-inspired hairstyle combines braids and poofy hair into one adorable updo."Braided Mohawk"GA mohawk comprised of one giant braid. It's very edgy and stylish!"Crashing Wave Mane"6A medium-length haircut often sported by surfers."Ruby Spikes"yShort hair with sharp, upward spikes at the front and crown. This style is popular with fledgling trainers in Hoenn."Short, Neat Spikes"rNeatly arranged spikes that look intimidating and disciplined. The style was popularized by Gym Leader Brock."Square-Cut Bangs"dMedium-length hair with messy square-cut bangs. This cut is usually seen on young Bug Catchers."Artistic Waves"]Waves cascading from your head that look almost too precise to be messy. Now that's art!"Buzz Cut"PA clean, close-cropped buzz cut for a sharp and low-maintenance appearance."Windswept Locks"cStraightened hair with a middle part. It catches the wind as you chase down legendary Pokemon."Over-Shoulder Braid".A long braid that goes over the shoulder."Wildfire Updo"NA wild, unkempt hairstyle that resembles the flaming heat of the kitchen."Ponytail Spiky Bangs"hLong, beautiful bushy hair tied in a thick ponytail. The style was popularized by Gym Leader Clair."Pointy Pompadour"UA pointy geled pompadour, to make you look like a totally normal academy student"Side Slick Fade"IA short hairstyle popular in Kalos, inspired by Poison-type Pokemon."Cornrows"cNeatly braided cornrows that run close to the scalp that create a sleek and intricate pattern."Dancer"VBraids put up in a ponytail. They flow with the rhythm of the music as you dance."Twinleaf Tresses"eA long, half-updo style with blunt bangs. Popular among fledgling trainers in the Sinnoh region."Eevee Tail"@A puffy ponytail that looks just like the tail of an Eevee."Neat Backwave"zShort, combed back to hair that give a tidy and professional appearance. This style was popularized by Professor Elm."Emo Bangs"_A styled haircut with long, angled layers and sweeping bangs for a dramatic and edgy look."Bandana Straight Hair"vMedium-length hair that falls straight down around a gray bandana. The style was popularized by Gym Leader Erika."Fade Haircut"iA fade haircut with gradually shortened sides and back, blending seamlessly into longer hair on top."Droopy Bangs"mMedium-length bangs that flow beautifully in the wind. This style was popularized by Gym Leader Falkner."Lava Plume Ponytail"GA topknot ponytail that flares out into a brilliant plume of 