t like the teethed antenna of a Mawile."Sapphire Side Tails"yMedium-length brown hair with a fringe and side-swept bangs. This style is popular with fledgling trainers in Hoenn."Flowing Twin Tails"{Long hair styled into voluminous twin tails with delicate, flowing strands that give off a magical and ethereal appearance."High Twin Tails"{Long hair styled into high, puffy twin tails with straight, side-swept bangs that give off a vibrant and playful look."Bow and Stripes"QA cute hairstyle featuring long twintails with stripey highlights and a bow."Two-Toned Afro"lAn large two-toned afro with a zigzag pattern. A very bold choice, only for the most disco of trainers."Spiky Medium Hair"iMedium-length hair that looks beautiful and youthful. The style was popularized by Gym Leader Misty."Spiky Side Pigtail"aShort, spiky hair with a spiky side ponytail. The style was popularized by Gym Leader Misty."Mod Bob"[Chin-length hairstyle with sharp and geometric lines that was popular a long time ago."Short Mohawk"oA short mohawk with the rest of the head shaved to a buzz cut. It's a style popular with punks and bikers."Elegant Mom Pony"LAn elegant hairstyle popular with moms. It's practical and fashionable!"Messy Mom Bun"KA messy hairstyle typically seen on moms who really deserve a break..."Mudkip Flip"@A spiky, flipped hairstyle inspired by the gills on Mudkip."Mullet".Business in the front, party in the back!"Fork and Knife Cut"0A hairstyle worn by those who love to cook."Short, Shaggy spikes"sShort, shaggy spikes that go well with visor-type hats. The style is popular with fledgling trainers in Unova."Accessorized Corn Rows"ALong corn rows with accesories, the last in kalosian fashion"Shaggy Ponytail"gA long, low ponytail that gives off a mysterious air. The style is popular with trainers in Unova."Joyful Puffs"RNeatly coiled twin buns perched high on each side, radiating care and warmth."Side Joyful Puff"MA single coiled bun perched high on one side, radiating care and warmth."Elegant Waves"YA sophisticated hairstyle that's popular with a lot of trainers with corporate jobs."Pom-Pom Puffs"0Big, bubbly twin puffs bursting with cheer!"Soft Side Bangs"kShort hair with soft, fluffy bangs parted to the sides, often worn by sensitive souls such as artists."Pigtails"[High, bouncy pigtails tied with ribbons, adding a fun and youthful touch to your look."Pixie Cut"nA short, playful pixie cut with closely cropped sides and a bit of length on top for a modern, airy look."Polished Scalp">A completely bald head with some polish to make it shiny!"Pompadour"HA dramatic, swept-back hairstyle with towering volume at the front."Punk Tails"BHigh, wild twin ponytails bursting with volume and rebellion."Rising Star Dreads"NStylish dreadlocks tied up in a bun. Some hang down loosely in the front."Short Hat Hair"HShort spiky hair that's been flattened by constantly wearing a hat."Edgy Asymmetrical Cut"DAn edgy, asymmetrical hairstyle with a highlight in the center."Combover"eA sleek, neatly styled combover with a side part that creates a polished and refined appearance."Paldean Ponytail"VA long ponytail with spiky bangs, just like the Paldean Elite Four member Rika's."Long Pigtails Buns"An eye-catching hairdo with two large side buns that continue into long pigtails. It's popular with fledgling trainers in Unova"Roserade (Medium)"QMedium-length spiky hair that's styled to resemble a Roserade's head flower."Roserade (Short)"JShort, spiky hair that's styled to resemble a Roserade's head flower."Studious Pigtails"NTwo long, straight pigtails that are secured by a large, fan like ribbon."Poison Barb Ponytail"]A spiky topknot that's sure to intoxicate all who look upon you onstage as you rock out."Bone Braids"mWickedly cool braids styled to look like bones. It's modeled after Paldean rapper Ryme's signature look."Clairvoyant Cut"pA medium-length cut with a fringe that frames the face.The style was popularized by the Gym Leader Sabrina."Telekinetic Tresses"zA long hairstyle with blunt bangs. It seems to flow independently of the wind. Popularized by the Gym Leader Sabrina."Paradox Cut"YA hairstyle reminiscent of one that was known to be popular a long, long time ago..."Samurai"=A hairstyle just like the one that a samurai would wear!"New Moon Points"RA short hairstyle with two distinct points. It almost looks like Skitty ears."Straight Side Bangs"^Short, smooth hair that frames the face nicely and gives a trainer a youthful appearance."Short Beard"tEither you miraculously got the ability to grow beard, or you got creative with glue and salon floor clippings."nVery short hair with square-cut bangs framing the face, giving a trainer a youthful, charming appearance."Short Spikes"AA short, spiky hairstyle popular with the alternative crowd."Single Back Braid",A simplistic long braid along the back."Slick Mullet"|A slicked-back mullet. It was popular when your parents were young, but it has since started to come back into fashion."High Side Pony"`An elegant ponytail worn to the side that was popularized by a Galarian research assistant."Eon Bob"SA layered bob with long, outward curls, exuding a gentle and mysterious charm."Surge Spikes"EA spiky haircut often worn by members of the Kantonian military."Tied-back Wicks"YFour very thick, chunky, cylindrical locs tied back behind the head in a cool style."Tied-back Dreads"iSome dreads that are half-up, half-down. It keeps them out of your face while still looking stylish."Torchic Tuft"OA topknot-style ponytail inspired by the little tufts on a torchic's head."Tyranaspikes"9Sharp spikes that look like the hide of a Tyranitar."Flyaway Short Cut"_A messy, wind-swept crop with long, asymmetrical bangs that's popular in the Kalos region."Veteran Bob"`Short, practical hair styled into a neat bob with subtle layers, giving a no-nonsense look."Spiky Sideburns"lA spiky hairstyle with long sideburns. This style was popularized by Volkn